<Slide notes={`按当前能力合同整理动作的归属。先看身份：林岚所在的 Agent 框里，可用原语是 MOVE、ACT、WAIT、SPEAK、INTERACT，没有 SET_OBJECT_STATE。公告栏自己的框里才有 ACT、WAIT 和 SET_OBJECT_STATE，同次动作还可带 responses，但只能引用真实待处理请求 ID。

两条路线都要经过 world-act 校验：当前身份、目标、参数。校验过后，每位参与者每个 Step 最多成功接受一次动作选择，随后由世界提交形成事实。

接受选择和形成事实是两个阶段，中间还有权限边界：Agent 不能代改对象状态，对象只能改自身状态。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.5.4　六种动作分别表达什么</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>动作原语与参与者控制权</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 172, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>Agent 身份（如林岚）</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 96, height: 36, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>MOVE</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 80, height: 36, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>ACT</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 92, height: 36, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>WAIT</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 96, height: 36, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>SPEAK</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 116, height: 36, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>INTERACT</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>没有 SET_OBJECT_STATE</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 172, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>固定对象身份（如公告栏）</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 80, height: 36, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>ACT</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 92, height: 36, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>WAIT</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 190, height: 36, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>SET_OBJECT_STATE</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>同次动作可带 responses，仅引用真实待处理请求 ID</Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 24, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#276FBF' }}>↓</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 24, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#26816B' }}>↓</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 76, background: '#20344B', borderRadius: 10, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, padding: '0 22px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>world-act　校验当前身份、目标、参数</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 388, height: 36, background: '#CB6B28', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Agent 不可代改对象状态 · 对象只能改自身状态</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 24, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#20344B' }}>↓</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 64, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>每位参与者每 Step 最多成功接受一次动作选择</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 64, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>随后由世界提交形成事实</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.5 感知、导航与动作</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>17 / 23</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
